'''Onderonians''' were a cultural group of [[human]] [[Homeworld|natives]] who called the [[Inner Rim Territories|Inner Rim]] [[jungle]] [[planet]] [[Onderon]], their [[homeworld]].

==History==
The Onderonians were originally primitive [[human]]s who lived near the [[jungle]]s of [[Onderon]]. To protect themselves, they built fortified settlements to keep the jungle's dangerous predators at bay. Eventually these settlements would become enormous walled cities such as [[Iziz]].<ref name="Databank Onderon" /> Some [[Onderonian outcasts|outcasts]] ended up living within the world's jungles, where they domesticated and rode [[ruping]]s.<ref name="Ruping DB">{{Databank|ruping|Ruping}}</ref>

During the [[Separatist Crisis]] and the [[Clone Wars]], the Onderonians were represented in both the [[Galactic Republic]]'s [[Galactic Senate]]<ref name="War on 2 Fronts">{{TCW|A War on Two Fronts}}</ref> and the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]]' [[Separatist Senate|Parliament]] by [[Mina Bonteri]].<ref name="HoBS">{{TCW|Heroes on Both Sides}}</ref> However, the Onderonians' king, [[Ramsis Dendup]] wished for their homeworld to be neutral during the Clone Wars since both the Republic and the Confederacy were corrupt.<ref name="TVE">''[[Star Wars: The Visual Encyclopedia]]''</ref>

At the [[First Battle of Geonosis|onset]] of the [[Clone Wars]], the Separatists put an end to Dendup's monarchy and installed [[Sanjay Rash]] as the new Onderonian king.<ref name="War on 2 Fronts" /> Additionally, Bonteri, despite having fully joined the Separatist cause,<ref name="HoBS" /> was killed by Separatist [[agent]]s after the [[Confederate–Republic peace initiative]].<ref name="Pursuit of Peace">{{TCW|Pursuit of Peace}}</ref> A [[Onderon rebels|group]] of Onderonians under the leader of [[Lux Bonteri]], [[Steela Gerrera]] and her brother [[Saw Gerrera]] asked for help from the [[Jedi High Council|Jedi Council]] to help them [[Onderonian Civil War|reclaim]] their home and reinstall Dendup as their true king. With help from the Jedi,<ref name="War on 2 Fronts" /> the Rebels were able to force the [[Separatist Droid Army]] under General [[Kalani]] to retreat from Onderon.<ref name="TP">{{TCW|Tipping Points}}</ref>

Following the reorganization of the Republic into the [[Galactic Empire]] Gerrera, his group and several civilian refugees were branded as insurgents by Admiral [[Wilhuff Tarkin]]. They hid in the jungles to evade the Imperial forces. He sent in [[Clone Force 99]] to deal with Gerra's insurgents, but they refused.<ref name="Aftermath">{{TBB|Aftermath (episode)}}</ref> Later, a new Imperial [[Elite Squad]] was sent in, eliminated several of Gerrera's fighters, and killed several of the civilian refugees.<ref name="Replacements">{{TBB|Replacements}}</ref> Gerrera launched a [[Onderon insurgency|bloodly insurgency]] against the Empire on Onderon<ref name="THO">{{Rebels|The Honorable Ones}}</ref> but ultimately declared his homeworld a lost cause and fled.<ref name="Ultimate New">''[[Ultimate Star Wars, New Edition]]''</ref>

